{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_07",
  "title": "制動失靈",
  "storyCode": "RS-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7c45631c61a0d2de8681b2e9d7e8c57fbbce8e9e0092e47e94d0ff67ba34022",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "侍女長，周圍的人都已經疏散了，你怎麼還留在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "休露絲夫人才是，您不是應該已經迴避了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "哼，你說迴避我就要迴避嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "這座雕像可是所有人的心血，要是出了岔子，我要怎麼和其他人交代？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "是所有人的心血，還是恩希歐迪斯的心血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "……難怪剛才我就看到聖女大人把你按了回去，看來聖女大人對你說過一些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "夫人並不驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "我又不是傻子，聖女大人看起來毫不知情，但她怎麼可能真的毫不知情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "只是，以她的立場來說，知道，但又不知道，才是她最應該做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "而她現在派你來捅破這層窗戶紙，說吧，什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "正在靠近這裡的人，一個是鐧，一個是維多利亞的“灰禮帽”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”\n嘖，他難道……不，應該不至於……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "聖女大人是刻意留你在這裡給我提醒的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "您就當作是這麼一回事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "雕像這邊交給我就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "咳……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……不愧是黑騎士，個人實力不容小覷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "不過如果只是這樣，您應該清楚，您是對付不了我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我不討厭有自信的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "不過，我的耐心有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你來回逃竄的樣子，已經開始讓我覺得有點無聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "我很抱歉，女士。讓您感到無聊是我的失職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "只不過，恕我直言，鐧女士，您的招式中沒有殺意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾經在卡西米爾所向披靡，以一把巨劍令對手聞風喪膽的黑騎士，如今卻用著這樣沒有鋒刃的武器——\n嘶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "這種沒有鋒刃的武器對付你足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "用萊塔尼亞的巨劍比賽，是那些商人的訴求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "呵，“用巨劍的萊塔尼亞武者”、“用不了源石技藝的怪胎”……隨便怎麼說都可以，無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "但好像時間久了，你們都忘了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "最開始我選擇鐧做武器的理由——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "什麼……呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人的話被襲面而來的風雪堵回口中。\n襲向他的是謝拉格刺骨的寒風，是壓面而至的無情山雪，是冰冷而重萬鈞的長鐧。\n不容任何反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "咳哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "這只是一個警告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "來找恩希歐迪斯麻煩的人很多，如果每一個都能碾死了事，我的麻煩也會少很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "可惜，有些人活著比死去更有用處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "就比如你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "咳、咳咳……原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "看來還要多謝，鐧女士手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "鐧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我用它的理由很簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "它沒有刃，用它，留你們這樣的人一條命會變得輕鬆一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "就算是這種沒有利刃的武器，只要再多用一點力氣，大部分人就會變成一攤肉泥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "從以前開始，一直如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "有一些人稱得上對手，大多數人卻會被輕易碾碎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "不管是萊塔尼亞的術師，還是卡西米爾的騎士，都沒什麼不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "信念也好，理想也好，再高漲的情緒，再堅定的意志，在力量面前都不堪一擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "太簡單就壞掉也是一種困擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以鐧為名的女人居高臨下地俯視面前的維多利亞人，這並不是一個好對付的敵手，因此才會由她，也只能由她來出面應對。\n可即便如此，要擊敗對手也並不困難。\n以一介無法使用源石技藝的貧民為起點，到成為騎士競賽蟬聯三屆冠軍的黑騎士，這一路走來並不簡單。\n但這之後的一切卻又都太簡單了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "哈……與“天生的武者”黑騎士相比，大部分人確實都可以用“脆弱”來形容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "別誤會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "如果你再認真一點，我也得費點心思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "我很遺憾，作為情報人員，我應該認真的地方，從來不是戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "哇哦，他們已經打到鷹架上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "這個“灰禮帽”還真有點本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "在鐧的手下從雪山一路逃竄到湖心島，放眼整個謝拉格，應該沒人能做得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "而這樣的人竟然在維多利亞還有許多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "哎呀，這片大地真可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "是啊，這片大地真可怕，每天都要應付這些麻煩事，我好想找個人代替我當聖女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "別想啦，聖女有今天的地位不也是你自找的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你和你哥哥在這方面倒是挺像的，總是喜歡為自己找事做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "不許說我和他一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "好吧好吧，那就他跟你一樣，行了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "雅兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "你還記得我們的約定吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "嗯？哪一個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "別裝傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "好啦，我當然記得，“耶拉岡德只需要看著祂的子民就足夠了”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "當時的我已經有些作弊了……要是連這件事也要依賴祂，那我也好，他也好，我們的理想都只是一句空話罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "……當旁觀者要比你想的辛苦一些哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "那就只能請祂忍耐一下啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "好吧，雖然不知道祂能不能聽到我們的約定就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "反正，我只是來看一看還能不能給這座雕像動動手腳而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "你果然沒放棄——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "只有這一點，我是絕對不會放棄的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "哇，鐧剛才那一腳，我總覺得整座雕像好像歪了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "唔，“灰禮帽”也不差，居然抓住雕像的手指調整身體的平衡，真不是蓋的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "他們能不能幫我瘦個臉啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "唉，最早的時候不懂事，覺得外表怎樣都好，也就不太在乎自己的儀表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "後來交流得多了，美感也就跟著人變了，才逐漸有了今天的樣貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "但是，那些典籍裡的畫像一直存在，早知道從埃德懷斯家出去的時候，應該拿走那些有我畫像的典籍的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "誰知道這時他們忽然要建耶拉岡德雕像啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "哇，一眨眼的工夫，這兩個人就已經爬上雕像的頂端了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "哎，對，那邊的臉頰可以再削一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "啊呀，別把鬢角也削掉啊，那個我還挺喜歡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "嗯……從這個角度看，好像還可以接受？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "而且，認識恩雅以後，反倒跟著她開始注意起自己的儀表了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "每次陪著她偷偷出去逛街，她都會推薦一堆可愛的小玩意，不知道什麼時候開始，我自己也喜歡上這些東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "對哦，剛才鬢角削掉的地方或許可以改成飾品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "這個可以記一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "哇，“灰禮帽”好慘，想要從頭頂跳下來，但是被鐧一腳給踢飛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "真可憐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "我在想，鐧以前的對手，是不是就跟“灰禮帽”現在的心情一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "明知道自己不是對手，但沒有辦法，總要掙扎一下，說不定有機會呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "直到最後發現自己果然還是沒有機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "那些為了財富而站上戰場的人，要比他更軟弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "滿意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我看你看著我們給雕像修容好像挺開心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "結果滿意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "嗯，還不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你要去哪呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "他那樣死不了，早晚會回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我還得去看著他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你確定你不會被他甩掉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "雖然正面過招他不是你的對手，但是他成心想要甩掉你恐怕也不是難事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "而且，也不能保證他不是誘餌，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "……這些事，我會交給恩希歐迪斯判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯現在顧不上這邊，這點你應該比我還清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "交給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "確切地說，交給聖女大人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雅兒晃了晃手中的通訊終端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你都聽到了嗎，聖女大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "交給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "鐧小姐辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "今晚的營火晚會，你會來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "免了，我不太喜歡熱鬧的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你打算怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "要看住一個外國使節，一些外交手段比武力要更有效些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "他可不算外國使節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "他可以是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "也好，那就麻煩聖女了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "這邊可不是離開的方向哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的謝拉格人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，該不會死了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的謝拉格人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別圍著看了，先想辦法把人撈上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的謝拉格人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看裝扮，好像是外國人，這天氣的水溫，就是我們當地人也不太扛得住啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "請問，發生什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的謝拉格人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "剛才從湖心島的方向忽然飛過來一個人，把冰面砸出了一個洞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "什麼？！嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "讓一讓，請讓一讓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈洛德擠過人群，定睛一看，頓時啞然失笑。\n結冰的湖面被砸出一個美麗的圓形，而圓形的中央，漂浮著一具“死屍”。\n而他正是為了接應這具“死屍”來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "這個水溫，嘶——我這把身子骨可受不了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "請問哪位有帶棍子一類的東西嗎？這是我的朋友，我來把他撈上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的謝拉格人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖，還真沒有能用的工具，要不去問附近冰釣的鄉親借根釣竿來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用了，我有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "噢，太好——\n咦，羅莎琳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗨，大叔，又見面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我的武器借你，先救人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圍觀的謝拉格人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們也來幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "藉著羅莎琳的武器，在周遭人的齊心協力之下，大家總算是把“死屍”撈了上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔，看起來還沒死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "雖然我不太願意承認，不過他要是死了，那麼事情可能就麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "唉，下手的人也理解這一點，所以才留手了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "先把他搬到溫暖的地方去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "老闆，借用一下烤爐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這不是約翰嗎？他應該在山上啊，怎麼會摔到這裡來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "山上？你遇到過他了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我在山上遇到他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不，沒什麼，只是說起來有點麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "大叔你呢，你這兩天做什麼呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "哈哈，我原本就是代表維多利亞來祝賀耶拉岡德像落成的，而儀式就在明天，結束後我就該打道回府了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "所以我就趁著最後的機會，到處走一走，給妻女買了點紀念品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "大叔你還真閒啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "年輕的時候總是想做更多的事，到了我這個歲數才知道，還是清閒一點好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "咳咳咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "哦，“屍體”活了"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嘔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "“約翰”，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "羅莎琳小姐，還有子爵閣下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "太好了，我剛才都見到我死去的外祖父了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你怎麼成這樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "這就，說來話長了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "您和您的父親，相處得還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呃，就那樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "父親？發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”&烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "這就說來話長了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "怎麼回事，“約翰”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "在我不知道的情況下，你居然變得比我和羅莎琳還要好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "終於找到你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "咦，聖女大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "聖女？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "初雪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "咦，烈夏，你也在啊，那正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "正好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "子爵閣下應記得，今晚會在銀心湖邊舉辦一場營火晚會，作為明天落成儀式的預熱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "我聽說您最近四處遊山玩水，怕您忘了，所以特意來提醒一二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "我當然記得，請放心，我一定到場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "烈夏也一起來吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "營火晚會？好啊，好啊，我一定到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "這位“灰禮帽”先生，我可以認為是您的朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "……是的，當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "既然是子爵閣下的朋友，那就是我謝拉格的客人，希望您也能賞臉參加這場晚會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……既然是聖女大人的邀請，豈有不從的道理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "那就……這麼定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
